        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Switched to using spring's ContentDisposition utility to encode filenames. It retains spaces as spaces, and replaces a lot of other whitespace and control characters with spaces.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Some characters could cause the request to error out, such as newlines which produce the response:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "<h1>Bad Message 400</h1><pre>reason: Illegal character VCHAR='\"'</pre>",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
