  "description": "<p>When using the client to create a binary resource with a filename, the client is URI encoding the value of the filename. So in the following example:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nclient.put(resourceUri)\r\n       .filename(<span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span> is my file.txt\"</span>)\r\n       ...</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>The ebucore:filename field in fedora ends up as \"this+is+my+file.txt\"</p>",
